From 6c47b7307d0d772aa62efef8970f0af464eed156 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 16:29:17 +0000
Subject: [setup] add focus-aware radar navigation, pane roster, and Codex
 titles

Base: marktoda/zj-radar v0.4.1 (e4b9d9ca1f0e8743320910db86978f43881361c9)

Compatibility: Zellij 0.45 plugin SDK (horizontal mouse-scroll events)

Behavior: on-demand native session navigation, presence-owned live badge, stable rows, stock Codex pane titles by default, opt-in radar titles, 10 FPS glyphs, floor-aligned footer, and empty-tab retirement

Build: nix develop -c cargo build -p zj-radar-plugin --target wasm32-wasip1 --release --locked
